<title>UK: NW Europe offshore oil, gas rigs steady at 58.</title>
<headline>NW Europe offshore oil, gas rigs steady at 58.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs in operation offshore northwest Europe was steady at 58 in the week to December 18, consultants Arthur Andersen said in a report.</p>
<p>U.K. rigs fell one to 18, while Norway rose one to 18.</p>
<p>Dutch drilling was unchanged at eight rigs. The Danish tally was steady at four rigs active.</p>
<p>Onshore U.K. drilling was down one rig at two.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
